        {
          "content": "# Company Handbook\n\nThe authoritative source for how we operate. This document is **canonical**: it is\nimmutable and carries a 1.5x search boost in qp-vault.\n\n## Principles\n\n- Knowledge that can't be verified can't be trusted.\n- Every fact has provenance, every read is verified, every write is auditable.\n\n## Governance\n\nResources move through a lifecycle (draft, review, active, superseded, archived) and\ncarry a trust tier. Search results are weighted by tier.",
          "cid": "vault://sha3-256/2a19522a7633ff6542c8e29c0f67349e734af6a326b4709af7c15ff491a467b0"
        }
      ]
    },
