        {
          "content": "# Security Policy\n\nAll content entering the vault is screened by the Membrane, chunked, and assigned a\nSHA3-256 content id (CID). The CID is `vault://sha3-256/<digest>`.\n\n## Verification\n\nAnyone can re-derive a resource's content id offline and confirm it matches. Tampering\nwith stored content changes its CID and is detected immediately.",
          "cid": "vault://sha3-256/32d04f0675bb54272cb188b9fda169775ba7f1004947c5d1b6c9a3917b8d2386"
        }
      ]
